      "message": "This seems a little confusing, only because it\u0027s named `refs` but it\u0027s traversed like a list. It\u0027s actually a dictionary of dictionaries (http://cdn.pasteraw.com/7rrl9jgw9zy5xg6ywpv70dr78obmhya). \n\nWe might be able to improve the name a bit: \n\n    # this is actually a dictionary where the key is the endpoint identifier and\n    # the value is the endpoint reference.\n    dict_of_endpoint_refs \u003d self.catalog_api.list_endpoints_for_project(project_id)",
